# Backend

FastAPI service for `{{projectName}}`.

## Requirements

- Python 3.13+
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (recommended)
- Docker (recommended for full-stack dev)
{{#if withPostgres}}
- PostgreSQL 17
{{/if}}
{{#if withCelery}}
- Redis 7
{{/if}}

## Run with Docker

```bash
docker compose up --build
```
{{#if withPostgres}}

Migrations run automatically on container start via `start.sh`.

To create a new migration after changing models:

```bash
dude db makemigration --message "describe change"
dude db migrate
```
{{/if}}
{{#if withCelery}}

Celery worker and{{#if withCeleryBeat}} beat scheduler and{{/if}} Flower monitor are started automatically by docker compose.
Flower UI: <http://localhost:5555>
{{/if}}

## Run locally (without Docker)

```bash
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

Then open <http://localhost:8000/api/health>.

